    "body": "@andytom Are you sure about that one?\r\n\r\nI made a dummy example and it seems that toggling `-e` is still required. 🤔 \r\n```bash\r\n#!/bin/bash\r\n\r\nset -euo pipefail\r\n\r\nfn() {\r\n  echo \"start\"\r\n  if true; then\r\n    false # simulate failing command\r\n    printf \"result: %s\" $?\r\n  fi\r\n  echo \"end\" # this never gets printed!\r\n}\r\n\r\nfn\r\n```",
